    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Clon War&quot; is a game in which you have to survive a fight against an influx of clones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's fight enemies and be strong</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is played in a roguelike genre, and as the stage progresses, the enemies become stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing the stage will give you a reward and you will grow too. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's dress ourselves up</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the game, you can get the goods based on the results, which you can use when you visit the store. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's decorate ourselves with individuality, not only the appearance of the character, but also accessories and effects.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's keep a record</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can check various records, such as the highest stage level and the number of enemies defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some records will appear on the leaderboard for others to see, so aim for high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to manipulate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918600/extras/a1f08dc2f2d194fba251ddd9707fc78e.avif?t=1738508660\" width=550 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can click the ? icon at the top of the title screen to see how to operate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Language Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918600/extras/ab8e54a2b1b31e891d83cea349b24a1c.avif?t=1738508660\" width=550 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change the language in the game from Option &gt; Language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918600/extras/82d0b9605d202046967df799f28cf3ce.avif?t=1738508660\" width=550 height=250 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918600/extras/a87c53aefa0051f680c019b1ea82c364.avif?t=1738508660\" width=550 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the Steam Library page, you can check the ranking by clicking View My Challenges &gt; Full Ranking Table.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Clon War&quot; is a game in which you have to survive a fight against an influx of clones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's fight enemies and be strong</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is played in a roguelike genre, and as the stage progresses, the enemies become stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing the stage will give you a reward and you will grow too. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's dress ourselves up</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the game, you can get the goods based on the results, which you can use when you visit the store. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's decorate ourselves with individuality, not only the appearance of the character, but also accessories and effects.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's keep a record</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can check various records, such as the highest stage level and the number of enemies defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some records will appear on the leaderboard for others to see, so aim for high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to manipulate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918600/extras/a1f08dc2f2d194fba251ddd9707fc78e.avif?t=1738508660\" width=550 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can click the ? icon at the top of the title screen to see how to operate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Language Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918600/extras/ab8e54a2b1b31e891d83cea349b24a1c.avif?t=1738508660\" width=550 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change the language in the game from Option &gt; Language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918600/extras/82d0b9605d202046967df799f28cf3ce.avif?t=1738508660\" width=550 height=250 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918600/extras/a87c53aefa0051f680c019b1ea82c364.avif?t=1738508660\" width=550 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the Steam Library page, you can check the ranking by clicking View My Challenges &gt; Full Ranking Table.</p>",
